        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, borehole heat exchanger, specific heat demand 10W
Dataset for disposal of borehole heat exchanger in heating system with specific heat demand of 10W/m2 heated gross floor area;
UUID: 11730e87-f2e2-433c-b060-a9c1a715a5b4
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in waste water treatment plants in Switzerland.
Technology: wastewater treatment of used carrier liquid, other components rest in ground.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_11730e87-f2e2-433c-b060-a9c1a715a5b4.xml</text>
